Third-party material

  This licence covers the Unbraid source code and its own assets. It
  does not extend to:

  - Third-party dependencies, which carry their own licences (see the
    `node_modules` metadata or `package-lock.json`).

  - Any musical score a user imports. Scores remain under whatever terms
    their own rights holders set. Unbraid stores them only in the
    user's browser and never transmits them.

  - The test fixtures in `fixtures/`:

      wellerman-fixture-simple.musicxml
      wellerman-fixture-shared-staff.musicxml
      cut-time-fixture.musicxml
        Original works written as test fixtures, released public
        domain / CC0. Not transcriptions of any published arrangement.

      bach-bwv269.musicxml
        J.S. Bach, BWV 269. The music is public domain; the file was
        exported from the music21 corpus, which is BSD-licensed.

